  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Shoreline Seabird/Marine Mammal Count",
  "description": "Data Type: Birds/Mammals; Seabird and marine mammal counts along shorelines of Naked, Storey, Peak and Smith Islands of Prince William Sound. Surveys completed in: June 1978-1980 and 1989-1994. July 1878 and August 1978. Transects were preset Fish and Wildlife transects. The filenames and descriptions are as follows: 1) CENLOG Census log with date, time, conditions, islands 2) CENSPECI # OF EACH SPECIES BY LOG id and shoreline section 3) SECAREA sq/km of each shoreline section 4) SECORD LAT/LONG of each shoreline section\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
